1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:30,000
= kisskh.club =

2
00:00:58,477 --> 00:01:00,812
Previously on Dating Alys Perez.

3
00:01:00,843 --> 00:01:01,730
Alys

4
00:01:01,730 --> 00:01:02,689
Zyril

5
00:01:02,733 --> 00:01:03,483
Perez,

6
00:01:03,578 --> 00:01:04,662
will you marry me?

7
00:01:04,779 --> 00:01:06,197
I now pronounce you,

8
00:01:06,305 --> 00:01:07,139
man and wife.

9
00:01:07,527 --> 00:01:09,446
So, where are we going?

10
00:01:09,756 --> 00:01:12,383
I just can't believe we're finally married!

11
00:01:12,408 --> 00:01:15,453
You will get married.
And you'll do what I say!

12
00:01:15,887 --> 00:01:18,640
If he doesn't marry you,
then you're not coming home!

13
00:01:18,952 --> 00:01:20,537
I'll cut all your resources!

14
00:01:20,736 --> 00:01:24,239
You will stay here until
that jerk marries you!

15
00:01:26,838 --> 00:01:28,390
Stop it, Alys.

16
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:30,377
We both know how this is going to end.

17
00:01:31,023 --> 00:01:32,400
One of us has to go.

18
00:01:32,733 --> 00:01:34,318
You're married to him.

19
00:01:34,777 --> 00:01:36,237
And we're having a child.

20
00:01:36,237 --> 00:01:38,531
Can't you see how
crazy our situation is?

21
00:01:38,990 --> 00:01:42,034
This baby will be labeled a bastard, Alys.

22
00:01:42,326 --> 00:01:43,619
A bastard!

23
00:01:44,370 --> 00:01:45,413
Fier, wait!

24
00:01:45,413 --> 00:01:46,872
- Wait, let's talk—
- Ouch!

25
00:01:47,123 --> 00:01:49,875
- Oh my god! Fier, are you okay?
- Ouch!

26
00:01:49,959 --> 00:01:51,293
Fier, how are you feeling?

27
00:01:51,293 --> 00:01:53,254
Shut up, Alys!
Ouch!

28
00:01:53,254 --> 00:01:54,630
- Do you want to go to the ER?
- Stop it, Alys!

29
00:01:54,630 --> 00:01:55,506
- Alys, stop!
- Please.

30
00:01:55,506 --> 00:01:57,091
- Alys, stop!
- Fier!

31
00:01:57,216 --> 00:01:59,301
- Where does it hurt?
- What happened?

32
00:02:00,177 --> 00:02:01,762
I don't know.

33
00:02:02,138 --> 00:02:04,974
She just started screaming.
I don't know.

34
00:02:05,850 --> 00:02:06,642
Drake,

35
00:02:06,642 --> 00:02:08,436
would you tell your wife

36
00:02:08,686 --> 00:02:11,272
that I'm not here to be her best friend.

37
00:02:12,023 --> 00:02:13,733
Stop trying to be my friend.

38
00:02:13,733 --> 00:02:15,192
I don’t need one.

39
00:02:17,778 --> 00:02:19,280
- Fier, let me —
- No need!

40
00:02:19,655 --> 00:02:20,322
I can do this.

41
00:02:20,322 --> 00:02:21,407
I don’t need your help.

42
00:02:23,242 --> 00:02:26,787
Drake, I'm sorry, I didn't know
it would be bad for her.

43
00:02:26,787 --> 00:02:29,040
I didn't know it would
be bad for the baby.

44
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:30,291
I’m so sorry.

45
00:02:30,958 --> 00:02:32,501
It's not your fault.

46
00:02:33,294 --> 00:02:34,420
Have you eaten?

47
00:02:36,881 --> 00:02:38,090
What about Fier?

48
00:02:39,050 --> 00:02:40,009
Okay.

49
00:02:40,426 --> 00:02:41,302
I'll talk to her.

50
00:02:41,635 --> 00:02:43,095
Please check on her.

51
00:02:49,852 --> 00:02:53,814
Is she really that mad at me
that even when she’s struggling

52
00:02:53,814 --> 00:02:56,650
she won't accept my help?

53
00:03:01,489 --> 00:03:04,200
Was it a mistake to move here?

54
00:03:04,617 --> 00:03:06,577
Maybe Tofer was right.

55
00:03:06,702 --> 00:03:09,914
Living here has done
more harm than good.

56
00:03:13,793 --> 00:03:15,211
Alys.

57
00:03:16,128 --> 00:03:18,130
Uncle! Good evening.

58
00:03:18,130 --> 00:03:19,548
What are you doing here?

59
00:03:19,548 --> 00:03:20,716
Is Drake still not here?

60
00:03:21,801 --> 00:03:23,803
He's upstairs, talking to Fier.

61
00:03:24,011 --> 00:03:25,805
Oh, I see.

62
00:03:29,650 --> 00:03:30,567
Uhm...

63
00:03:30,810 --> 00:03:31,727
Uncle?

64
00:03:32,269 --> 00:03:33,854
Is there something you’d like to say?

65
00:03:34,688 --> 00:03:36,618
I really don't know what to say, Alys.

66
00:03:38,067 --> 00:03:40,277
All I know is, I want you for Drake.

67
00:03:41,278 --> 00:03:43,030
And I'm happy you're married.

68
00:03:43,030 --> 00:03:44,115
But Fier,

69
00:03:44,448 --> 00:03:46,117
she’s carrying my grandchild.

70
00:03:46,992 --> 00:03:48,786
And I can't make her leave.

71
00:03:54,367 --> 00:03:55,945
Uncle Steve.

72
00:03:58,963 --> 00:04:01,298
It’s just hard to be
in the middle, Alys.

73
00:04:06,237 --> 00:04:07,864
Alys, don't worry.

74
00:04:08,097 --> 00:04:09,431
I just need to rest.

75
00:04:11,061 --> 00:04:12,078
Excuse me.

76
00:04:27,616 --> 00:04:29,785
All I want is for us to be civil.

77
00:04:30,703 --> 00:04:32,288
The three of us.

78
00:04:32,913 --> 00:04:34,498
We can do it, right?

79
00:04:35,666 --> 00:04:37,543
I won’t abandon you, Fier.

80
00:04:37,918 --> 00:04:40,504
And all you need to do is to cooperate.

81
00:04:47,761 --> 00:04:48,906
Civil?

82
00:04:50,181 --> 00:04:52,183
You think it's that easy?

83
00:04:52,926 --> 00:04:56,596
You think just because I’m under
your roof, you can control me?

84
00:04:56,645 --> 00:04:58,281
I'm not Alys.

85
00:04:58,511 --> 00:05:00,055
I’m not someone you can order around.

86
00:05:00,357 --> 00:05:01,567
You don't own me.

87
00:05:01,567 --> 00:05:04,528
You can’t control me
whenever you want.

88
00:05:04,649 --> 00:05:06,109
Well if that's the case,

89
00:05:06,989 --> 00:05:09,226
it's probably better
if you don't stay here.

90
00:05:09,533 --> 00:05:12,119
Let’s think of another way
to make this work.

91
00:05:16,165 --> 00:05:18,542
If I had any other choice.

92
00:05:19,210 --> 00:05:20,461
Well, you're right.

93
00:05:20,794 --> 00:05:23,714
And you know that I love Alys.

94
00:05:24,256 --> 00:05:26,133
And because I love her so much,

95
00:05:26,592 --> 00:05:28,886
I'll do whatever it takes
to fix things between us.

96
00:05:29,365 --> 00:05:31,284
So if you want to slap me,

97
00:05:31,847 --> 00:05:32,736
go on.

98
00:05:33,265 --> 00:05:35,601
I'll just stand here and take it.

99
00:05:36,852 --> 00:05:38,896
But don’t get confused, Fier.

100
00:05:41,398 --> 00:05:42,650
You can hurt me.

101
00:05:43,776 --> 00:05:45,729
But you can never hurt Alys.

102
00:06:12,388 --> 00:06:13,530
Drake!

103
00:06:13,555 --> 00:06:15,099
She slapped him again.

104
00:06:17,297 --> 00:06:18,947
Does it hurt a lot?

105
00:06:24,608 --> 00:06:25,776
Liar.

106
00:06:31,553 --> 00:06:33,138
I have a solution, Drake.

107
00:06:34,743 --> 00:06:36,120
Alys,

108
00:06:36,745 --> 00:06:39,498
please don't tell me
you're leaving again.

109
00:06:40,874 --> 00:06:44,753
I'm not leaving.
You’ll still see me anyway.

110
00:06:45,504 --> 00:06:47,639
It’s just that I won’t
be living here anymore.

111
00:06:47,935 --> 00:06:49,395
So you are leaving?

112
00:06:49,675 --> 00:06:50,592
Dummy!

113
00:06:50,592 --> 00:06:52,052
I'm married to you!

114
00:06:52,052 --> 00:06:53,512
How far do you think I'll go?

115
00:06:53,929 --> 00:06:58,058
Even if you’re just an
inch away from me, I’ll miss you.

116
00:06:58,708 --> 00:07:01,377
If I could just put you in my pocket,
I would’ve done it already.

117
00:07:03,355 --> 00:07:09,320
You must have put a spell on me
so I'd go crazy without you.

118
00:07:13,741 --> 00:07:16,243
Drake, my decision is final.

119
00:07:17,328 --> 00:07:19,288
I'm leaving for now.

120
00:07:19,997 --> 00:07:22,416
But don't worry,
I'm not running away from you.

121
00:07:23,042 --> 00:07:29,423
It just hurts seeing Fier take her
anger out on you because of me.

122
00:07:31,342 --> 00:07:33,677
I’ll always be one call away.

123
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,889
You're sure you won't
run away from me?

124
00:07:37,181 --> 00:07:38,474
Never!

125
00:07:40,184 --> 00:07:42,353
To the moon and back, remember?

126
00:07:43,715 --> 00:07:44,597
Yeah.

127
00:07:45,324 --> 00:07:47,493
To the moon and back.

128
00:07:48,650 --> 00:07:49,651
Alys.

129
00:07:49,651 --> 00:07:50,694
Hmm?

130
00:07:52,063 --> 00:07:53,106
I love you.

131
00:07:57,845 --> 00:08:00,097
I love you more.

132
00:08:06,001 --> 00:08:07,211
I love you most.

133
00:08:22,059 --> 00:08:26,647
Mom, Dad, I'm really sorry
about my decision with Drake.

134
00:08:27,815 --> 00:08:29,650
It's done, dear.

135
00:08:29,650 --> 00:08:31,235
You’re married now.

136
00:08:31,235 --> 00:08:33,112
There's nothing we can do about it.

137
00:08:33,612 --> 00:08:38,200
And I realized that you're at the
right age to decide for yourself.

138
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:42,204
What matter's most is that
you stand by your decision,

139
00:08:42,204 --> 00:08:45,290
that you are ready for all
the consequences.

140
00:08:45,290 --> 00:08:46,208
Okay, dear?

141
00:08:47,167 --> 00:08:48,419
Thanks, Mom.

142
00:08:48,752 --> 00:08:51,755
You know what Alys,
I truly wish you all the best.

143
00:08:52,297 --> 00:08:54,883
More than anything,
your peace of mind.

144
00:08:56,176 --> 00:08:57,261
Alys,

145
00:08:57,261 --> 00:08:59,179
what if you just come home?

146
00:08:59,388 --> 00:09:00,764
At least, you won't be alone.

147
00:09:00,764 --> 00:09:02,891
You'd be with me, Dane and your mom.

148
00:09:04,186 --> 00:09:05,727
No, I'm fine, Dad.

149
00:09:05,727 --> 00:09:08,522
I want to learn how to live on my own.

150
00:09:08,522 --> 00:09:13,026
And besides, I don't want to live under
your shadow for the rest of your lives.

151
00:09:13,026 --> 00:09:16,113
And I know that
you guys mean well, but

152
00:09:16,113 --> 00:09:18,532
I just really need this for myself.

153
00:09:19,074 --> 00:09:21,493
Okay, dear.
I understand.

154
00:09:21,493 --> 00:09:25,622
As long as you call us if
you ever need anything, alright?

155
00:09:25,622 --> 00:09:28,876
Home is always waiting
in case you change your mind.

156
00:09:28,876 --> 00:09:30,252
I know.

157
00:09:31,336 --> 00:09:35,048
Anything you need,
we're always here, okay?

158
00:09:35,424 --> 00:09:37,134
Okay, Dad.

159
00:09:37,134 --> 00:09:38,635
Thanks, Mom.
Thanks, Dad.

160
00:09:38,635 --> 00:09:40,179
Love you, bye.

161
00:12:00,027 --> 00:12:02,487
Hello, husband.

162
00:12:06,283 --> 00:12:07,549
Drake?

163
00:12:08,619 --> 00:12:09,786
You okay?

164
00:12:11,321 --> 00:12:12,614
Why are you so quiet?

165
00:12:13,332 --> 00:12:15,375
I'm just worried about you, Alys.

166
00:12:16,585 --> 00:12:17,753
Come on.

167
00:12:18,699 --> 00:12:19,866
I'm fine!

168
00:12:20,422 --> 00:12:21,590
We're fine.

169
00:12:23,091 --> 00:12:24,551
Alys, tell me the truth.

170
00:12:25,969 --> 00:12:27,012
How are you?

171
00:12:29,222 --> 00:12:30,641
Honestly, a little tired.

172
00:12:30,641 --> 00:12:31,892
But...

173
00:12:32,184 --> 00:12:35,020
considering everything that's happened,

174
00:12:36,313 --> 00:12:38,064
this is the least that I can do.

175
00:12:39,066 --> 00:12:40,859
I want to be with you.

176
00:12:42,194 --> 00:12:44,267
This is only temporary, Drake.

177
00:12:45,820 --> 00:12:46,844
I just...

178
00:12:47,222 --> 00:12:51,476
I don’t want to be the reason
Fier’s pregnancy becomes complicated.

179
00:12:53,955 --> 00:12:56,041
This is all for the better.

180
00:12:56,041 --> 00:12:57,918
Trust me, okay?

181
00:13:01,588 --> 00:13:02,673
Alys?

182
00:13:04,383 --> 00:13:07,761
I'm sorry you have
to go through all this.

183
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:10,889
Don't be sorry, Drake.

184
00:13:11,473 --> 00:13:13,642
We decided this together.

185
00:13:13,892 --> 00:13:16,937
So, we have to face this together.

186
00:13:17,604 --> 00:13:18,689
Don't worry.

187
00:13:18,897 --> 00:13:20,524
It'll only be for less than a year.

188
00:13:21,233 --> 00:13:23,193
After Fier gives birth,

189
00:13:23,985 --> 00:13:25,946
everything will be alright.

190
00:13:26,238 --> 00:13:27,406
Okay?

191
00:13:30,575 --> 00:13:32,244
I'm so lucky to have you, Alys.

192
00:13:35,706 --> 00:13:37,124
- I love you.
- I love you.

193
00:13:47,884 --> 00:13:49,469
Stop moving.

194
00:13:49,469 --> 00:13:51,888
Bestie, it's already too thick!

195
00:13:51,888 --> 00:13:53,598
How are we supposed to look good then?

196
00:13:54,850 --> 00:13:55,767
I don’t —

197
00:13:55,767 --> 00:13:57,185
It's done!

198
00:13:58,687 --> 00:13:59,896
It's done!
Stop complaining.

199
00:13:59,896 --> 00:14:00,731
Fine.

200
00:14:02,482 --> 00:14:04,818
I already put it on you,
and you didn’t even say thank you.

201
00:14:06,194 --> 00:14:07,320
So...

202
00:14:07,863 --> 00:14:09,656
- What?
- How long are you staying here?

203
00:14:09,656 --> 00:14:12,951
I bet you'll be back
at Drake's in one week.

204
00:14:13,342 --> 00:14:15,177
You're so mean to me.

205
00:14:16,695 --> 00:14:18,113
But you know, Bestie?

206
00:14:18,138 --> 00:14:19,166
Hmm?

207
00:14:19,166 --> 00:14:21,042
I'm honestly impressed.

208
00:14:21,637 --> 00:14:22,721
How do you handle this?

209
00:14:23,837 --> 00:14:27,048
Honestly, I don’t even know
how I manage to do this.

210
00:14:27,340 --> 00:14:30,927
I guess that's how it is
with your one true love.

211
00:14:31,260 --> 00:14:32,568
I don't know what's with you, Bestie.

212
00:14:32,593 --> 00:14:34,094
You’re being such a martyr.

213
00:14:35,234 --> 00:14:36,485
Oh gosh!

214
00:14:39,060 --> 00:14:40,078
Wait.

215
00:14:40,236 --> 00:14:42,113
How is your shop doing, by the way?

216
00:14:43,148 --> 00:14:45,567
Well, I haven't checked
in on it for a while.

217
00:14:45,750 --> 00:14:49,159
Good thing I have staff I can trust.

218
00:14:49,576 --> 00:14:50,698
Mhm.

219
00:14:51,737 --> 00:14:53,573
You know, Bestie,

220
00:14:55,118 --> 00:14:56,557
I really missed this.

221
00:14:57,746 --> 00:14:59,909
Our sleepovers.

222
00:15:00,836 --> 00:15:02,870
Our playful banters.

223
00:15:03,168 --> 00:15:05,253
I wish we were back in high school.

224
00:15:05,253 --> 00:15:07,589
Do you remember what our only
problem was back then?

225
00:15:08,087 --> 00:15:10,089
Whether we should copy
each other’s answers.

226
00:15:11,510 --> 00:15:13,512
You know what I never
understood back then?

227
00:15:14,012 --> 00:15:15,388
Why did we even copy off each other

228
00:15:15,388 --> 00:15:16,723
when we were both stupid?

229
00:15:17,057 --> 00:15:17,974
I mean,

230
00:15:19,559 --> 00:15:21,853
what kind of grades did we expect?

231
00:15:21,853 --> 00:15:22,813
Team Stupid.

232
00:15:25,482 --> 00:15:28,151
What I’m going to eat at the cafeteria?

233
00:15:28,527 --> 00:15:30,862
What course I’m going to take in college?

234
00:15:31,238 --> 00:15:32,948
Whether you’d graduate.

235
00:15:34,866 --> 00:15:38,495
You’re being too much.
You’re really being too hard on me!

236
00:15:38,495 --> 00:15:39,996
Bestie!

237
00:15:39,996 --> 00:15:41,498
That was too much.

238
00:15:42,457 --> 00:15:44,584
You know, I have a surprise for you.

239
00:15:44,584 --> 00:15:45,544
What?

240
00:15:45,544 --> 00:15:46,878
Close your eyes, first.

241
00:15:47,546 --> 00:15:49,506
- What is it?
- Just close your eyes!

242
00:15:49,506 --> 00:15:52,843
Aya, if that's a cockroach,
I'm telling you right now...

243
00:15:55,387 --> 00:15:56,638
- What?
- Look.

244
00:15:59,975 --> 00:16:02,519
- Stop! It's weird!
- Remember this, Bestie?

245
00:16:02,519 --> 00:16:04,312
- Bestie!
- Stop that, Aya!

246
00:16:04,312 --> 00:16:06,648
You're still a witch.
Stop it!

247
00:16:09,734 --> 00:16:11,403
[In Japanese] Welcome!

248
00:16:17,701 --> 00:16:19,369
Thank you!

249
00:16:28,348 --> 00:16:29,988
Looks like we’re not busy today, huh?

250
00:16:31,035 --> 00:16:32,816
Can’t I just miss you?

251
00:16:32,841 --> 00:16:34,718
Miss me? Jeez...

252
00:16:34,749 --> 00:16:36,208
Here. Go eat.

253
00:16:37,429 --> 00:16:38,638
So...

254
00:16:38,638 --> 00:16:41,516
How's your soap opera
of a life these days?

255
00:16:42,142 --> 00:16:43,476
You know Tofer,

256
00:16:44,394 --> 00:16:46,062
you're the biggest gossip ever.

257
00:16:47,606 --> 00:16:49,441
But, the thing is...

258
00:16:49,900 --> 00:16:52,736
I was just concerned for Fier because

259
00:16:53,361 --> 00:16:55,280
she's having a hard time.

260
00:16:55,655 --> 00:16:58,366
Wow, you’re more
concerned about Fier?

261
00:16:58,658 --> 00:17:00,285
While you on the other hand,

262
00:17:00,994 --> 00:17:03,204
have to suffer because of my cousin.

263
00:17:04,122 --> 00:17:05,874
I've told you about this too many times.

264
00:17:06,458 --> 00:17:07,959
You're just stubborn.

265
00:17:10,261 --> 00:17:12,553
So, how is Tripp?

266
00:17:14,169 --> 00:17:15,217
You know what,

267
00:17:15,242 --> 00:17:17,286
you’re really good at
changing the subject.

268
00:17:19,346 --> 00:17:21,181
Seriously, how is he?

269
00:17:21,796 --> 00:17:24,951
Well, still nursing a broken heart.

270
00:17:24,976 --> 00:17:28,355
Meanwhile, you're messed up dealing
with situation with Drake.

271
00:17:29,064 --> 00:17:31,066
He's messed up too.

272
00:17:31,441 --> 00:17:32,984
He hasn't really moved on from you.

273
00:17:34,152 --> 00:17:36,613
You know, this isn't a joke, Tofer.

274
00:17:36,613 --> 00:17:37,697
We're both fine.

275
00:17:37,697 --> 00:17:38,823
I just talked to him!

276
00:17:38,823 --> 00:17:39,908
You're just—

277
00:17:40,116 --> 00:17:40,992
Gosh, fine!

278
00:17:40,992 --> 00:17:42,827
Suit yourself if you
don’t want to believe me.

279
00:17:48,732 --> 00:17:49,686
Hey!

280
00:17:50,846 --> 00:17:52,473
You're spacing out again, Perez.

281
00:17:53,380 --> 00:17:54,773
Looks like you’re still buffering.

282
00:17:54,798 --> 00:17:55,741
Hey!

283
00:17:56,130 --> 00:17:56,811
Hey!

284
00:17:58,218 --> 00:17:59,636
You're gross!

285
00:18:10,146 --> 00:18:11,940
Thank you, Tofer.

286
00:18:12,649 --> 00:18:14,609
Anytime, Perez.

287
00:18:20,991 --> 00:18:22,367
Hey, Bestie!
What's up?

288
00:18:22,367 --> 00:18:23,493
Where are you?

289
00:18:23,493 --> 00:18:26,037
- Good morning, Ms. Aya.
- Good morning!

290
00:18:26,037 --> 00:18:27,664
Good morning, Ms. Aya.

291
00:18:27,664 --> 00:18:29,958
I'm with Tofer at Botejyu, why?

292
00:18:30,333 --> 00:18:31,334
Oh, okay.

293
00:18:32,836 --> 00:18:35,463
But I'm heading to Drake's office later.

294
00:18:37,465 --> 00:18:39,134
You know, Bestie,

295
00:18:39,134 --> 00:18:41,344
it's great that you're going out.

296
00:18:41,344 --> 00:18:43,596
So you don’t have to think
about your problems all the time.

297
00:18:44,347 --> 00:18:46,016
Yes, thank you, Bestie.

298
00:18:46,016 --> 00:18:46,683
Okay.

299
00:18:46,683 --> 00:18:48,476
See you soon.
Love you, bye!

300
00:18:48,476 --> 00:18:49,561
Bye, bestie.

301
00:18:51,396 --> 00:18:52,313
Eat up!

302
00:18:52,647 --> 00:18:53,398
I am!

303
00:18:53,398 --> 00:18:54,482
You too.
Eat!

304
00:18:54,607 --> 00:18:56,026
Food trip!
Let's go!

305
00:18:56,026 --> 00:18:57,193
With Botejyu!

306
00:18:57,193 --> 00:18:58,361
Let's go!

307
00:19:01,531 --> 00:19:02,824
Hello, husband!

308
00:19:04,075 --> 00:19:06,202
I got you some food!

309
00:19:07,454 --> 00:19:08,830
What are you doing here?

310
00:19:09,289 --> 00:19:11,082
Can't I visit my husband?

311
00:19:11,958 --> 00:19:13,058
What are you doing?

312
00:19:13,460 --> 00:19:14,753
Just reading reports.

313
00:19:16,775 --> 00:19:17,847
Okay.

314
00:19:20,805 --> 00:19:21,848
How's Fier?

315
00:19:27,873 --> 00:19:29,215
Why do you ask?

316
00:19:30,602 --> 00:19:31,582
No reason.

317
00:19:32,748 --> 00:19:35,792
I just want to know if she's okay.

318
00:19:36,900 --> 00:19:38,276
I hope she and her baby are—

319
00:19:38,276 --> 00:19:39,444
She's okay.

320
00:19:41,738 --> 00:19:43,531
And she will be okay, Alys.

321
00:19:46,871 --> 00:19:48,128
I missed you.

322
00:19:48,828 --> 00:19:49,829
Come on.

323
00:19:49,829 --> 00:19:53,249
You're always at my condo.
How can you miss me?

324
00:19:54,050 --> 00:19:55,871
I will miss you every day.

325
00:19:56,824 --> 00:19:58,188
All the time.

326
00:19:58,244 --> 00:19:59,161
Every minute.

327
00:19:59,417 --> 00:20:00,585
Every second.

328
00:20:01,941 --> 00:20:04,193
Whatever you say, Drake Sebastian.

329
00:20:06,221 --> 00:20:07,222
Okay.

330
00:20:07,222 --> 00:20:09,849
Just keep doing whatever you're
doing and I'll just stay here.

331
00:20:10,020 --> 00:20:11,438
Okay, wifey.

332
00:20:12,127 --> 00:20:13,545
Okay, hubby.

333
00:20:30,537 --> 00:20:31,871
Thank you, Drake.

334
00:20:31,896 --> 00:20:35,010
Of course, I'm always
at your service, Alys.

335
00:20:36,167 --> 00:20:39,045
I almost forgot, we didn't have dessert.

336
00:20:39,045 --> 00:20:41,214
Do you want me to order
a strawberry shortcake?

337
00:20:41,714 --> 00:20:44,175
And your car needs an oil change.

338
00:20:44,175 --> 00:20:45,718
Let's have it done next week.

339
00:20:45,718 --> 00:20:46,636
Drake...

340
00:20:47,804 --> 00:20:48,596
What?

341
00:20:50,140 --> 00:20:51,933
You don't have to
come with me every day.

342
00:20:52,746 --> 00:20:53,662
What?

343
00:20:56,104 --> 00:20:58,565
It's like you feel compelled
to be with me all the time

344
00:20:58,565 --> 00:21:00,775
because we're married but

345
00:21:01,416 --> 00:21:02,577
it's not the case.

346
00:21:03,150 --> 00:21:04,069
Why?

347
00:21:11,520 --> 00:21:12,562
Fier needs you.

348
00:21:12,996 --> 00:21:14,806
Even if she doesn't need you,

349
00:21:14,909 --> 00:21:16,160
your child will.

350
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:19,502
Alys, I'm doing everything I can.

351
00:21:20,243 --> 00:21:21,244
Really?

352
00:21:22,466 --> 00:21:25,511
Have you ever accompanied
her to a doctor's appointment?

353
00:21:26,968 --> 00:21:28,444
Drake, I'm here with you.

354
00:21:28,516 --> 00:21:29,935
I'm here to stay.

355
00:21:30,138 --> 00:21:32,974
But you also need to
face your responsibilities.

356
00:21:33,099 --> 00:21:33,766
But—

357
00:21:33,766 --> 00:21:35,059
I'm a woman too.

358
00:21:35,310 --> 00:21:37,729
And I know exactly what
Fier needs right now.

359
00:21:38,894 --> 00:21:40,514
I'm always okay.

360
00:21:41,277 --> 00:21:42,403
I promise.

361
00:21:44,402 --> 00:21:45,320
Okay.

362
00:21:46,946 --> 00:21:48,545
This is hard for me.

363
00:21:49,157 --> 00:21:51,451
But I don’t want to make it harder for you.

364
00:21:51,743 --> 00:21:55,538
I can bear it all,
as long as you don’t have to suffer.

365
00:21:55,872 --> 00:21:57,624
I love you so much, Drake.

366
00:22:23,775 --> 00:22:25,151
Drake.

367
00:22:29,822 --> 00:22:30,811
Yes?

368
00:22:35,145 --> 00:22:36,813
How's Alys?

369
00:22:38,831 --> 00:22:40,041
Getting by.

370
00:22:44,253 --> 00:22:45,463
Drake.

371
00:22:45,755 --> 00:22:48,174
I know this is not my business.

372
00:22:49,133 --> 00:22:50,677
But what are your plans?

373
00:22:51,552 --> 00:22:52,971
You can't keep going on like this.

374
00:22:54,073 --> 00:22:55,991
They're both getting hurt.

375
00:22:57,928 --> 00:22:58,679
I know.

376
00:23:00,895 --> 00:23:02,272
Fier is pregnant.

377
00:23:03,786 --> 00:23:06,581
She can't keep getting
stressed out over Alys.

378
00:23:06,734 --> 00:23:08,820
It's dangerous for the child.

379
00:23:11,823 --> 00:23:13,324
And Alys...

380
00:23:14,826 --> 00:23:16,327
Poor Alys.

381
00:23:17,870 --> 00:23:21,040
Do you know how many times I
caught her crying while she was here?

382
00:23:22,959 --> 00:23:26,546
I know she always says she's okay.

383
00:23:27,964 --> 00:23:29,691
But she's breaking, Drake.

384
00:23:32,343 --> 00:23:34,429
Soon, she'll be exhausted.

385
00:23:34,429 --> 00:23:35,555
And look at yourself.

386
00:23:36,055 --> 00:23:37,849
Aren't you getting tired of all this?

387
00:23:58,014 --> 00:23:58,988
Fier...

388
00:24:01,352 --> 00:24:03,175
I still won't marry you.

389
00:24:05,543 --> 00:24:06,794
I know.

390
00:24:06,794 --> 00:24:07,707
No.

391
00:24:09,881 --> 00:24:11,632
You're not listening.

392
00:24:12,717 --> 00:24:14,469
I'm married to Alys.

393
00:24:15,303 --> 00:24:16,846
And we're having a kid.

394
00:24:17,513 --> 00:24:19,292
But that’s as far as it goes.

395
00:24:22,442 --> 00:24:24,694
Fier, please stop doing this.

396
00:24:26,356 --> 00:24:28,707
Let's not make this any harder.

397
00:24:29,984 --> 00:24:33,446
You knew from the very beginning,
it has always been Alys.

398
00:24:34,042 --> 00:24:35,239
So, please.

399
00:24:35,239 --> 00:24:37,492
Don't make things complicated.

400
00:24:39,827 --> 00:24:42,497
Even if I beg over and over again,

401
00:24:43,581 --> 00:24:45,333
that's fine with me, Fier.

402
00:24:47,426 --> 00:24:48,677
Please.

403
00:24:51,589 --> 00:24:52,550
Okay.

404
00:24:54,242 --> 00:24:55,744
So now, what do you want?

405
00:25:00,014 --> 00:25:02,266
I’ll get a house for you.

406
00:25:04,310 --> 00:25:07,146
I'll make sure that you
will be well taken care of.

407
00:25:08,677 --> 00:25:11,513
I'll go with you to all your check-ups.

408
00:25:12,402 --> 00:25:15,238
And I'll give you everything you need.

409
00:25:17,057 --> 00:25:18,600
I'll be beside you

410
00:25:19,492 --> 00:25:22,662
whenever our child needs me.

411
00:25:24,529 --> 00:25:26,155
Alys is right.

412
00:25:29,043 --> 00:25:30,837
So Alys is the reason again?

413
00:25:37,927 --> 00:25:38,928
Okay.

414
00:25:39,887 --> 00:25:41,264
But for now,

415
00:25:41,264 --> 00:25:42,682
can you leave me alone?

416
00:25:45,768 --> 00:25:46,602
Leave!

417
00:26:22,373 --> 00:26:23,920
Hello, Chance?

418
00:26:24,330 --> 00:26:25,786
My decision is final.

419
00:26:30,271 --> 00:26:32,231
Help me leave this country.

420
00:26:34,692 --> 00:26:35,902
Yeah.

421
00:26:36,360 --> 00:26:37,612
In a week.

422
00:26:54,170 --> 00:26:55,505
- Shaira!
- Alys!

423
00:26:55,505 --> 00:26:58,090
You poor thing!

424
00:26:58,841 --> 00:27:00,521
We have to talk!

425
00:27:00,885 --> 00:27:02,887
Hey! Shaira!

426
00:27:03,638 --> 00:27:05,264
You don't have to harass Zy!

427
00:27:05,765 --> 00:27:07,950
I'm not harassing her, you dummy!

428
00:27:07,975 --> 00:27:09,560
I'm comforting her.

429
00:27:10,245 --> 00:27:11,622
She deserves it.

430
00:27:12,438 --> 00:27:13,356
And you!

431
00:27:13,648 --> 00:27:17,318
If I hadn't called Tripp, I wouldn't
have known how wrecked your life is!

432
00:27:19,153 --> 00:27:20,404
Hold on.

433
00:27:20,780 --> 00:27:22,532
I was supposed to head out today.

434
00:27:22,532 --> 00:27:24,408
No!

435
00:27:24,408 --> 00:27:26,619
You need a real shake up!

436
00:27:26,712 --> 00:27:29,381
This'll take a while, okay?

437
00:27:32,667 --> 00:27:33,960
Sorry.

438
00:27:37,588 --> 00:27:39,173
And then what?

439
00:27:39,674 --> 00:27:41,425
And then one day,

440
00:27:41,801 --> 00:27:44,679
while they were both single
at that time, they got drunk.

441
00:27:45,015 --> 00:27:47,059
And then it just happened.

442
00:27:47,890 --> 00:27:50,059
Oh my gosh, Drake!

443
00:27:50,270 --> 00:27:51,730
He’s such a mess.

444
00:27:51,922 --> 00:27:53,007
Now what?

445
00:27:53,663 --> 00:27:55,498
So now, her father disowned her

446
00:27:55,523 --> 00:27:57,900
all because he wants them to get married.

447
00:27:58,317 --> 00:27:59,986
How can that happen
when we're married?

448
00:27:59,986 --> 00:28:01,654
Exactly!

449
00:28:01,946 --> 00:28:05,116
And Fier herself is somewhat
a complicated person.

450
00:28:05,241 --> 00:28:07,785
So, just so I don't cause
any trouble and

451
00:28:07,785 --> 00:28:10,746
to make sure Fier's pregnancy goes well,

452
00:28:10,746 --> 00:28:12,177
I just decided to leave.

453
00:28:12,832 --> 00:28:13,666
What?

454
00:28:13,666 --> 00:28:14,122
She's making a point, right?

455
00:28:14,147 --> 00:28:15,857
That's why I'm here
in this condo right now.

456
00:28:16,933 --> 00:28:20,904
It's probably the hormones
that make her... difficult?

457
00:28:21,132 --> 00:28:23,593
I'm not quite sure but,

458
00:28:23,593 --> 00:28:26,387
I don't know.
I'm just trying to understand Fier.

459
00:28:26,387 --> 00:28:29,890
Because I'm pretty sure what
she's going through isn't easy.

460
00:28:31,392 --> 00:28:33,227
Hormones, my ass.

461
00:28:34,270 --> 00:28:37,732
I have a cousin that's pregnant.
And she's nothing like that.

462
00:28:37,892 --> 00:28:40,334
She's crazy as hell is what it is.

463
00:28:40,359 --> 00:28:42,862
- Actually!
- Hey, don't get all worked up.

464
00:28:42,862 --> 00:28:44,447
- What's so funny?
- Calm down.

465
00:28:44,587 --> 00:28:47,006
This isn't a laughing matter, Alys.

466
00:28:47,283 --> 00:28:49,118
Okay, maybe...

467
00:28:49,118 --> 00:28:51,996
she is going through a lot.
I'll give her that.

468
00:28:51,996 --> 00:28:54,707
But what you're going
through is no joke, Alys.

469
00:28:54,894 --> 00:28:56,183
OMG!

470
00:28:56,333 --> 00:28:59,061
I knew you were stupid
but not to this extent!

471
00:28:59,164 --> 00:29:01,416
- Hey!
- My god, please!

472
00:29:01,565 --> 00:29:02,673
You don't have to call her stupid!

473
00:29:02,673 --> 00:29:04,425
That's what she is!

474
00:29:04,634 --> 00:29:06,135
What's done is done.

475
00:29:06,135 --> 00:29:08,220
It is what it is. It's over.

476
00:29:11,140 --> 00:29:12,642
And also, did I mention?

477
00:29:12,850 --> 00:29:14,560
Fier keeps slapping Drake!

478
00:29:14,852 --> 00:29:15,936
- What?!
- I couldn't take it.

479
00:29:16,062 --> 00:29:17,438
I can't take that.

480
00:29:17,438 --> 00:29:20,191
I’d rather leave than
let that happen again.

481
00:29:21,317 --> 00:29:22,610
That's it!

482
00:29:22,743 --> 00:29:24,203
My patience has run out.

483
00:29:24,320 --> 00:29:26,697
I'm gonna go and smack
some sense into that girl!

484
00:29:26,697 --> 00:29:28,741
- Hey, calm down!
- Where are you going Shaira?

485
00:29:30,368 --> 00:29:32,495
Hey, should we follow her?

486
00:29:32,557 --> 00:29:33,599
Better not.

487
00:29:33,996 --> 00:29:35,247
Let her be.

488
00:29:43,271 --> 00:29:44,343
Are you good?

489
00:29:45,364 --> 00:29:46,343
I can do this.

490
00:29:57,480 --> 00:29:58,355
Hey.

491
00:29:59,483 --> 00:30:00,609
Always remember...

492
00:30:01,774 --> 00:30:02,900
I'm right here.

493
00:30:04,495 --> 00:30:05,622
Of course.

494
00:30:05,837 --> 00:30:07,088
I know.

495
00:30:12,656 --> 00:30:13,949
Zy?

496
00:30:13,974 --> 00:30:15,434
I want to ask you something.

497
00:30:15,538 --> 00:30:16,538
Hmm?

498
00:30:18,390 --> 00:30:21,226
How are you so calm about all this?

499
00:30:23,754 --> 00:30:24,686
Why?

500
00:30:25,308 --> 00:30:26,726
How should I be?

501
00:30:28,451 --> 00:30:29,514
No.

502
00:30:29,927 --> 00:30:31,345
What I mean is,

503
00:30:32,218 --> 00:30:33,636
if it were someone else,

504
00:30:35,808 --> 00:30:39,019
maybe everything at
Uncle Steve’s place is already broken.

505
00:30:44,817 --> 00:30:46,499
Why am I like this?

506
00:30:49,363 --> 00:30:50,905
I keep thinking

507
00:30:51,657 --> 00:30:54,201
that I should be mad at Fier

508
00:30:54,201 --> 00:30:56,495
but I try to understand her instead.

509
00:30:58,998 --> 00:31:01,917
And she told me herself that

510
00:31:02,418 --> 00:31:05,296
she never wanted to stay
there in the first place.

511
00:31:05,919 --> 00:31:08,421
That she was a victim
of her dad's decision.

512
00:31:12,540 --> 00:31:14,491
It hurts to be called a mistress.

513
00:31:15,431 --> 00:31:17,280
It’s hard to be called a mistress.

514
00:31:19,786 --> 00:31:23,593
To have your child be called a bastard.

515
00:31:26,358 --> 00:31:27,413
I don't know.

516
00:31:28,944 --> 00:31:31,905
Fier’s situation is
really difficult right now.

517
00:31:33,910 --> 00:31:34,991
Well, you know,

518
00:31:35,993 --> 00:31:37,718
if you feel bad for Fier,

519
00:31:38,868 --> 00:31:40,311
I feel even worse for you.

520
00:31:43,417 --> 00:31:44,877
Like you always say,

521
00:31:45,753 --> 00:31:47,213
it's normal to cry.

522
00:31:48,714 --> 00:31:50,466
But like I always say,

523
00:31:51,300 --> 00:31:52,671
don't be hurt.

524
00:31:56,818 --> 00:31:58,280
Jeez...

525
00:31:59,225 --> 00:32:01,143
Our lives are so complicated.

526
00:32:02,254 --> 00:32:03,264
Well...

527
00:32:07,195 --> 00:32:11,074
Complications make the ending
much sweeter, don't you think?

528
00:32:12,071 --> 00:32:13,531
Damn, you're good.

529
00:32:13,531 --> 00:32:14,323
Damn right!

530
00:32:14,323 --> 00:32:15,699
I really look up to you.

531
00:32:15,699 --> 00:32:16,408
As you should.

532
00:32:16,408 --> 00:32:17,243
So good.

533
00:32:19,829 --> 00:32:20,679
Hey.

534
00:32:20,746 --> 00:32:21,780
Where are you going?

535
00:32:22,498 --> 00:32:23,457
I’ll follow Shaira.

536
00:32:24,500 --> 00:32:26,418
I have a feeling I know where she went.

537
00:32:26,815 --> 00:32:27,649
I'm coming too.

538
00:32:29,547 --> 00:32:30,381
Let's go.

539
00:32:35,261 --> 00:32:37,638
You know, sometimes I still wonder...

540
00:32:37,935 --> 00:32:39,202
Why Drake?

541
00:32:39,598 --> 00:32:42,101
Why not me? I'm more handsome.

542
00:32:42,935 --> 00:32:44,478
Are you being serious?

543
00:32:45,988 --> 00:32:47,280
Don’t argue with me.

544
00:32:47,700 --> 00:32:49,535
That’s the only thing
that makes me feel better.

545
00:32:49,884 --> 00:32:51,719
I look better than Drake.

546
00:32:56,365 --> 00:32:57,616
Relax.

547
00:32:57,825 --> 00:32:59,410
Just trying to make you laugh.

548
00:33:02,162 --> 00:33:03,202
Tripp?

549
00:33:03,622 --> 00:33:04,582
Hmm?

550
00:33:06,208 --> 00:33:07,167
Thank you.

551
00:33:09,378 --> 00:33:10,754
You never left me.

552
00:33:12,715 --> 00:33:14,550
I hope you'll always stay.

553
00:33:16,218 --> 00:33:18,053
I hope you never change.

554
00:33:23,309 --> 00:33:24,421
Not yet.

555
00:33:24,867 --> 00:33:26,061
I still can't.

556
00:33:26,896 --> 00:33:27,983
What?

557
00:33:28,772 --> 00:33:29,732
Nothing!

558
00:33:29,732 --> 00:33:31,066
It's nothing!

559
00:34:00,597 --> 00:34:02,099
Are you sure she's here?

560
00:34:02,124 --> 00:34:04,224
Who the hell do you think you are?!

561
00:34:04,224 --> 00:34:06,393
Are you some nepo baby or something?

562
00:34:06,393 --> 00:34:08,812
Shame on you for causing this mess.

563
00:34:08,812 --> 00:34:09,772
Told you.

564
00:34:09,772 --> 00:34:10,564
- Shit!
- Shit!

565
00:34:10,564 --> 00:34:11,815
- Shaira!
- You bitch!

566
00:34:11,815 --> 00:34:12,650
And who are you?!

567
00:34:12,650 --> 00:34:13,859
- Oh my god!
- That's enough, Ma'am.

568
00:34:13,859 --> 00:34:15,146
Let go of me!

569
00:34:15,194 --> 00:34:16,278
I'm not done with this bitch.

570
00:34:16,303 --> 00:34:18,013
- Let me handle this.
- Who is this, anyway?

571
00:34:20,240 --> 00:34:21,241
Who are you?

572
00:34:21,241 --> 00:34:22,551
Why are you meddling with us?

573
00:34:22,701 --> 00:34:24,119
I don't even know you.

574
00:34:24,463 --> 00:34:25,548
Nosy bitch.

575
00:34:26,096 --> 00:34:27,263
Excuse me?!

576
00:34:27,498 --> 00:34:30,292
I'm the best friend of the guy
whose baby you're carrying.

577
00:34:30,292 --> 00:34:31,477
And don't you dare

578
00:34:31,502 --> 00:34:32,878
call me a bitch.

579
00:34:32,962 --> 00:34:33,587
- Oh?
- Okay, okay.

580
00:34:33,672 --> 00:34:35,898
So would you rather be
called a trashy bitch then?

581
00:34:35,923 --> 00:34:36,632
Trashy bitch?

582
00:34:36,632 --> 00:34:37,174
Shaira.

583
00:34:37,174 --> 00:34:39,343
You came all the way
here just to yell at me.

584
00:34:39,593 --> 00:34:41,595
Who in their right mind does that?

585
00:34:41,673 --> 00:34:42,716
Crazy bitch!

586
00:34:43,013 --> 00:34:45,099
I said don't call me a bitch, you bitch!

587
00:34:45,099 --> 00:34:46,141
- Relax!
- Shaira, calm down.

588
00:34:46,141 --> 00:34:47,226
Everything's fine, Shaira.
Please...

589
00:34:47,226 --> 00:34:48,310
- Relax.
- My God.

590
00:34:48,769 --> 00:34:51,313
What poison did she feed
Drake to get her pregnant?

591
00:34:52,111 --> 00:34:55,310
Let alone even kiss her.
I can't stand the thought!

592
00:34:55,779 --> 00:34:57,277
You dreadful woman.

593
00:34:57,409 --> 00:34:59,787
Shaira, please! Stop it!

594
00:35:00,572 --> 00:35:01,782
Actually...

595
00:35:01,782 --> 00:35:03,158
You stop it!

596
00:35:03,158 --> 00:35:04,076
Whoa.

597
00:35:04,076 --> 00:35:08,217
I haven't a clue as to why
you're tolerating this bullshit!

598
00:35:09,148 --> 00:35:11,150
Alys, you married Drake.

599
00:35:11,266 --> 00:35:14,103
And in your pretty little mind,

600
00:35:14,292 --> 00:35:16,586
you don't seem to understand.

601
00:35:17,172 --> 00:35:18,882
Alys, wake up!

602
00:35:19,216 --> 00:35:20,801
You're the wife!

603
00:35:21,095 --> 00:35:22,912
Why did you have to leave?

604
00:35:22,970 --> 00:35:23,887
Oh, fuck it.

605
00:35:24,596 --> 00:35:27,016
Hey! I'm not done with
you yet, Ms. Homewrecker!

606
00:35:27,041 --> 00:35:27,975
Shaira.

607
00:35:27,975 --> 00:35:29,184
Miss Whoever-You-Are,

608
00:35:29,184 --> 00:35:31,228
watch your fucking words!

609
00:35:32,021 --> 00:35:33,105
You know nothing.

610
00:35:34,314 --> 00:35:36,734
Oh... I know plenty!

611
00:35:37,151 --> 00:35:40,631
And if Alys won't do anything about it,
I sure as hell will!

612
00:35:42,357 --> 00:35:43,263
Whatever.

613
00:35:43,605 --> 00:35:45,440
Believe what you want.

614
00:35:46,084 --> 00:35:47,252
It's your life.

615
00:35:47,953 --> 00:35:49,329
- Shaira.
- Wow!

616
00:35:49,329 --> 00:35:51,206
- Walk off, girl!
- Okay.

617
00:35:51,206 --> 00:35:52,875
- Walk off.
- Shaira, she's gone. Let's go.

618
00:35:52,875 --> 00:35:53,751
Let's get out of here.

619
00:35:53,751 --> 00:35:56,128
I'm not leaving.
I'm still waiting for Drake.

620
00:35:56,128 --> 00:35:57,713
Has he gone insane?!

621
00:35:58,870 --> 00:35:59,996
Jeez.

622
00:36:01,717 --> 00:36:02,959
Oh my god!

623
00:36:03,302 --> 00:36:05,357
Oh my god, he has gone insane!

624
00:36:05,596 --> 00:36:06,889
That explains this!

625
00:36:07,598 --> 00:36:08,682
What happened?

626
00:36:08,682 --> 00:36:09,975
There you are!

627
00:36:09,975 --> 00:36:10,517
Drake.

628
00:36:10,517 --> 00:36:12,943
Did you hear all that?
She was yelling at me.

629
00:36:13,645 --> 00:36:15,939
Where the hell did
you pick up that bitch?

630
00:36:16,440 --> 00:36:18,275
What'll happen to my godchild?

631
00:36:18,692 --> 00:36:20,194
The kid might grow up
with no manners.

632
00:36:20,194 --> 00:36:22,112
Drake, come on.
Where are your standards?

633
00:36:22,404 --> 00:36:24,573
I thought you were the
smartest person I know.

634
00:36:24,782 --> 00:36:26,175
But apparently not.

635
00:36:26,200 --> 00:36:28,844
If you wanted kids,
Alys is there anyway,

636
00:36:28,869 --> 00:36:30,245
or any of your other exes.

637
00:36:30,385 --> 00:36:32,179
Why does it have to be that woman?

638
00:36:33,136 --> 00:36:34,607
Shaira, I'm really tired.

639
00:36:36,259 --> 00:36:37,219
Tired?

640
00:36:38,003 --> 00:36:39,171
You're tired, Drake?

641
00:36:39,171 --> 00:36:41,131
The world doesn't revolve around you.

642
00:36:41,690 --> 00:36:42,649
What about Alys?

643
00:36:42,674 --> 00:36:44,259
Don't you think she's tired too?

644
00:36:44,927 --> 00:36:46,345
I know Alys is a saint.

645
00:36:46,512 --> 00:36:48,529
But it doesn't mean she agrees to all this!

646
00:36:49,048 --> 00:36:50,466
Am I right, Alys?

647
00:36:50,641 --> 00:36:51,545
Shaira.

648
00:36:52,101 --> 00:36:53,185
Don't meddle.

649
00:36:53,388 --> 00:36:54,857
Don't try to stop me!

650
00:36:55,062 --> 00:36:58,065
Alys is my friend and
I can't stand what's happening!

651
00:36:58,625 --> 00:37:00,668
It's foul on every single level.

652
00:37:01,360 --> 00:37:03,028
Drake, you married her.

653
00:37:03,403 --> 00:37:06,740
Now grow a pair and have
some goddamn responsibility.

654
00:37:08,867 --> 00:37:10,077
What do you want me to do?

655
00:37:10,511 --> 00:37:12,638
Be with her for Christ's sake!

656
00:37:12,663 --> 00:37:15,207
Leave that woman to her family!

657
00:37:15,207 --> 00:37:18,877
Your IQ is so high,
but your EQ is so low, Drake!

658
00:37:19,378 --> 00:37:22,881
Do you really think their family
would cut off their only daughter?

659
00:37:23,382 --> 00:37:25,974
My god, Drake, have I
become smarter than you?

660
00:37:26,009 --> 00:37:28,387
Okay! Shaira...

661
00:37:28,387 --> 00:37:30,722
Show's over. Let's go.

662
00:37:30,722 --> 00:37:32,516
- I'll take you home.
- Gladly.

663
00:37:33,433 --> 00:37:35,227
Drake, you're better than this.

664
00:38:07,327 --> 00:38:08,600
We're going.

665
00:38:10,053 --> 00:38:11,217
You two should talk.

666
00:38:13,307 --> 00:38:14,240
Just...

667
00:38:16,310 --> 00:38:18,187
Feel free to call me if you need me.

668
00:38:23,692 --> 00:38:24,763
Alys.

669
00:38:27,863 --> 00:38:29,489
Are you having a hard time?

670
00:38:30,532 --> 00:38:33,076
It's the first time he asked me how I feel.

671
00:38:36,121 --> 00:38:38,081
I just need to talk to Fier.

672
00:38:38,790 --> 00:38:40,000
Okay?

673
00:38:56,892 --> 00:38:58,268
Fier, please.

674
00:39:00,812 --> 00:39:02,314
Spare us.

675
00:39:04,983 --> 00:39:08,545
I want to be with Alys.
I'll still take care of you both.

676
00:39:13,964 --> 00:39:16,053
Do you really love her that much?

677
00:39:19,081 --> 00:39:20,599
Answer me!

678
00:39:23,710 --> 00:39:25,254
Get up, Drake!

679
00:39:25,402 --> 00:39:27,821
Do you think you can just
beg your way out of this?

680
00:39:29,161 --> 00:39:30,120
Come on, Drake!

681
00:39:31,385 --> 00:39:34,429
If you think it's hard for you,
its a thousand times worse for me!

682
00:39:36,119 --> 00:39:37,678
Is this all my fault?!

683
00:39:39,309 --> 00:39:41,478
Why do they keep
calling me a bitch?!

684
00:39:41,812 --> 00:39:43,355
Did I steal you from Alys?

685
00:39:43,730 --> 00:39:45,691
Did you have a girlfriend
when I was with you?

686
00:39:45,691 --> 00:39:47,734
You didn't, right?

687
00:39:50,779 --> 00:39:53,323
No woman ever wanted to be a mistress.

688
00:39:54,283 --> 00:39:55,659
I don't want to be.

689
00:39:57,244 --> 00:39:58,954
It was never my dream.

690
00:40:00,372 --> 00:40:02,124
But what can I do?

691
00:40:03,000 --> 00:40:06,336
You married Alys even
when you know I was here!

692
00:40:08,145 --> 00:40:10,939
The one who’s going
to be your child’s mother.

693
00:40:13,051 --> 00:40:14,803
Did you hear anything from me?

694
00:40:17,224 --> 00:40:18,558
Nothing!

695
00:40:20,434 --> 00:40:23,061
Because I fucking accepted it all!

696
00:40:24,187 --> 00:40:26,231
Because I knew there was nothing.

697
00:40:26,231 --> 00:40:28,005
It was Alys all along!

698
00:40:29,356 --> 00:40:31,775
But Drake, consider how I feel.

699
00:40:33,387 --> 00:40:35,306
I'm hurting too!

700
00:40:42,456 --> 00:40:43,373
Fier.

701
00:40:44,416 --> 00:40:45,459
Please.

702
00:40:46,918 --> 00:40:50,692
I'll be a good father to our child.

703
00:40:51,923 --> 00:40:54,551
But I really can't marry you.

704
00:40:56,293 --> 00:40:57,703
So that's it?

705
00:40:59,514 --> 00:41:00,599
Hmm?

706
00:41:02,225 --> 00:41:03,310
Look.

707
00:41:06,021 --> 00:41:08,732
I don't know why people
think you're so perfect.

708
00:41:09,858 --> 00:41:11,485
You got me pregnant.

709
00:41:12,486 --> 00:41:13,528
Yet somehow,

710
00:41:14,363 --> 00:41:16,490
you want me gone from your life.

711
00:41:18,950 --> 00:41:21,328
Yes, I threw myself at you.

712
00:41:22,371 --> 00:41:25,749
But it takes two to fucking tango.

713
00:41:25,749 --> 00:41:26,875
You wanted this, too.

714
00:41:27,039 --> 00:41:28,541
I'm sorry, Fier.

715
00:41:31,046 --> 00:41:32,770
What can your apology do now?

716
00:41:34,270 --> 00:41:36,333
Is your apology going
to be the father of my child?

717
00:41:36,971 --> 00:41:38,097
Of course not.

718
00:41:39,724 --> 00:41:41,264
You know what, Drake?

719
00:41:41,264 --> 00:41:43,392
You're so selfish!

720
00:41:45,769 --> 00:41:49,856
Maybe it's my turn to
be a little bit selfish too.

721
00:41:52,513 --> 00:41:56,767
I'll give you the freedom that you're
so fucking desperate to have.

722
00:41:57,287 --> 00:42:00,684
You're free from all responsibility
towards me or your child.

723
00:42:01,890 --> 00:42:04,559
But you should give up any
hope of seeing your child.

724
00:42:06,004 --> 00:42:09,138
Do you hear me, Drake?
Not a chance!

725
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:12,421
From now on, you don’t
have a child anymore.

726
00:42:12,838 --> 00:42:15,715
This child is mine,
and I’m their only parent.

727
00:42:16,258 --> 00:42:17,843
Do you understand?!

728
00:42:18,802 --> 00:42:21,513
Don't do this to me, please.

729
00:42:21,513 --> 00:42:23,794
Don't look at me like that.

730
00:42:25,851 --> 00:42:27,519
Isn't this what you wanted?

731
00:42:27,519 --> 00:42:29,479
I'm giving it to you!

732
00:42:30,522 --> 00:42:33,525
Don't expect me to
come on to your terms, Drake.

733
00:42:34,025 --> 00:42:36,027
I wasn't born to be a saint.

734
00:42:36,987 --> 00:42:39,614
I’m only human and I can be mean too.

735
00:42:40,574 --> 00:42:42,731
This is the best I could give.

736
00:43:12,564 --> 00:43:14,024
Fier!

737
00:43:17,736 --> 00:43:19,196
Fier, wait!

738
00:43:28,580 --> 00:43:30,206
Should I be happy now?

739
00:43:31,136 --> 00:43:32,262
This is it.

740
00:43:32,803 --> 00:43:36,337
She’s the one who decided
to walk out of our lives.

741
00:43:37,386 --> 00:43:39,346
But why does it feel so wrong?

742
00:43:39,833 --> 00:43:42,169
Why do I feel this way?

743
00:43:57,734 --> 00:43:58,902
Drake?

744
00:44:01,947 --> 00:44:03,406
It's okay to cry.

745
00:44:11,456 --> 00:44:12,916
Are you alright?

746
00:44:22,509 --> 00:44:24,761
I'm going to talk to Fier, okay?

747
00:44:26,346 --> 00:44:30,016
I'm going to tell her that
it's okay for her to stay here.

748
00:44:31,866 --> 00:44:33,821
Please don't be sad.

749
00:44:35,605 --> 00:44:38,441
It hurts me to see you like this.

750
00:44:39,236 --> 00:44:41,822
Is this what epic love feels like?

751
00:44:42,440 --> 00:44:44,609
When someone you love is hurting,

752
00:44:44,948 --> 00:44:46,376
it hurts you more.

753
00:44:46,741 --> 00:44:48,702
It hurts three times as much.

754
00:44:48,952 --> 00:44:50,912
Alys, why are you like this?

755
00:44:53,248 --> 00:44:54,541
Like what?

756
00:44:57,143 --> 00:44:58,861
Why did I fall

757
00:44:59,394 --> 00:45:01,479
for a selfless girl like you?

758
00:45:07,554 --> 00:45:10,473
I'm not like this to other people, Drake.

759
00:45:12,058 --> 00:45:14,227
If it was for someone else,

760
00:45:14,227 --> 00:45:16,730
I'd have put myself first.

761
00:45:18,282 --> 00:45:20,603
Survival of the fittest, right?

762
00:45:21,735 --> 00:45:24,821
But when it comes to you,

763
00:45:25,488 --> 00:45:28,033
you're my priority.

764
00:45:28,658 --> 00:45:32,330
I'm sure that you'd do
the same for me, right?

765
00:45:38,084 --> 00:45:39,544
Drake?

766
00:45:46,176 --> 00:45:47,385
Drake...

767
00:45:47,385 --> 00:45:48,637
I love you, Alys.

768
00:45:49,971 --> 00:45:51,765
I love you, my wife.

769
00:45:53,808 --> 00:45:55,977
Don’t talk to Fier anymore.

770
00:45:57,337 --> 00:45:59,751
But I want you guys to be okay.

771
00:46:00,568 --> 00:46:02,431
Everything will be okay.

772
00:46:03,318 --> 00:46:04,861
I know.

773
00:46:06,321 --> 00:46:07,611
I know, baby.

774
00:46:28,301 --> 00:46:31,805
I have already decided
to do things on my own.

775
00:46:31,805 --> 00:46:34,057
I don’t want to see you regret because

776
00:46:34,432 --> 00:46:37,894
you’re choosing me over your child.

777
00:46:39,229 --> 00:46:42,399
I don't want you to regret this one day.

778
00:47:15,181 --> 00:47:17,117
Fier, she's my life.

779
00:47:20,058 --> 00:47:21,844
We've been through so much.

780
00:47:23,898 --> 00:47:26,609
We’ve faced so many things together.

781
00:47:29,304 --> 00:47:32,063
And I don’t want to lose Alys again.

782
00:47:34,195 --> 00:47:36,211
I want to give her the best life.

783
00:47:37,922 --> 00:47:39,953
A life without any hassle.

784
00:47:41,166 --> 00:47:42,914
Without any more pain.

785
00:47:46,916 --> 00:47:48,680
Because I love her so much.

786
00:47:50,609 --> 00:47:54,047
I've been waiting so long for this chance.

787
00:48:01,060 --> 00:48:02,270
How about us?

788
00:48:07,369 --> 00:48:09,594
Fier, I keep telling you.

789
00:48:10,921 --> 00:48:12,977
I'm going to take care of you both.

790
00:48:16,916 --> 00:48:19,274
But I can't lie to you anymore.

791
00:48:22,165 --> 00:48:25,899
Fier, have you ever
loved someone so much

792
00:48:28,015 --> 00:48:30,726
that even when you forget about them

793
00:48:31,049 --> 00:48:32,758
or push them away,

794
00:48:35,261 --> 00:48:37,211
or even when you find someone else,

795
00:48:39,140 --> 00:48:41,476
your heart still goes back to them.

796
00:49:00,161 --> 00:49:01,547
Fier, please!

797
00:49:04,791 --> 00:49:05,899
Please!

798
00:49:07,710 --> 00:49:08,617
Spare us.

799
00:49:10,768 --> 00:49:12,395
Do you love her that much?

800
00:49:22,164 --> 00:49:23,434
Drake?

801
00:49:23,434 --> 00:49:26,729
On the next episode of
Dating Alys Perez.

802
00:49:26,729 --> 00:49:28,606
I don't know where Fier went.

803
00:49:28,706 --> 00:49:30,208
She’s with Cristine.

804
00:49:30,350 --> 00:49:32,143
I'm leaving Drake and everything.

805
00:49:32,318 --> 00:49:33,778
When will you leave?

806
00:49:34,028 --> 00:49:34,946
Please.

807
00:49:34,946 --> 00:49:36,948
Don’t help Fier leave the country.

808
00:49:36,948 --> 00:49:38,825
Will you be willing to let go of Drake?

809
00:49:38,825 --> 00:49:39,868
Fier, please.

810
00:49:39,868 --> 00:49:41,744
If you have a problem,
we can talk about it, please!

811
00:49:41,744 --> 00:49:43,539
Just stop the car, Zy, please!
